<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopia jails hijackers for 10 years.</title>
<headline>Ethiopia jails hijackers for 10 years.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Ethiopian court on Thursday jailed for 10 years each two hijackers found guilty of trying to force an Ethiopian Airlines plane to Djibouti in 1993, the state news agency said.</p>
<p>The Ethiopian News Agency said Lemma Hunde Kissis and former Lieutenant Gubenti Binegdi armed with a knife and a grenade tried to commandeer an Ethiopian Airlines Boeing 737 on a domestic flight and force it to the neighbouring Red Sea state of Djibouti.</p>
<p>They were both apprehended during the hijacking in June 1993, it added.</p>
